OL,3,GNEWSA'We're still cold paying #300 a
OL,4,Amonth energy bills'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSnell raised concerns about further
OL,7,Frises as millions of households in
OL,8,FEngland, Scotland and Wales face higher
OL,9,Fenergy bills from Thursday, when
OL,10,FOfgem's latest energy price cap
OL,11,Fincrease comes into force. The
OL,12,Fregulator said typical households on
OL,13,Fstandard variable tariffs will pay
OL,14,Fabout #60 more a year, taking annual
OL,15,Fbills to #1,723.
